3	Grace to be Born	53 Dr. Sixto Antonio Ave., Bgy. Kapasigan, Pasig City 1600	(+63) 2 654 1377	gtbbofficial15@gmail.com	Shepherd’s Voice Radio & Television Foundation, Inc.	Banco De Oro C/A # 3970019804\r\nBanco De Oro S/A # 160506123	/uploads/foundations/logo-1772072476103-557012018.jpg	/uploads/foundations/cover-1772072476105-947050872.png	Child Care, Pregnant Women, Women in Crisis	<p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Together&nbsp;with&nbsp;other&nbsp;young&nbsp;pregnant&nbsp;and&nbsp;unwed&nbsp;women&nbsp;caught&nbsp;in&nbsp;dysfunctional&nbsp;relationships&nbsp;and&nbsp;contemplating&nbsp;abortion,&nbsp;have&nbsp;found&nbsp;shelter&nbsp;in&nbsp;Grace&nbsp;to&nbsp;Be&nbsp;Born.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Grace&nbsp;to&nbsp;Be&nbsp;Born&nbsp;Maternity&nbsp;Home&nbsp;and&nbsp;Nursery,&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;halfway&nbsp;house&nbsp;established</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">in&nbsp;2009&nbsp;by&nbsp;Basti&nbsp;and&nbsp;Betty&nbsp;Roxas-Chua.&nbsp;This&nbsp;place&nbsp;serves&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;temporary&nbsp;shelter</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">for&nbsp;pregnant&nbsp;unwed&nbsp;mothers&nbsp;and&nbsp;an&nbsp;orphanage&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;children&nbsp;there.</span></p>	<p>Our&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;express&nbsp;the&nbsp;infinite&nbsp;compassion&nbsp;of&nbsp;God,&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author&nbsp;of&nbsp;Life,&nbsp;by&nbsp;bringing&nbsp;girls&nbsp;and&nbsp;women&nbsp;in&nbsp;crisis&nbsp;pregnancy&nbsp;to&nbsp;experience&nbsp;a&nbsp;taste&nbsp;of&nbsp;God’s&nbsp;loving&nbsp;care&nbsp;by&nbsp;providing&nbsp;them&nbsp;with&nbsp;confidential&nbsp;and&nbsp;wholistic&nbsp;services&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;able&nbsp;to&nbsp;bring&nbsp;their&nbsp;unborn&nbsp;babies&nbsp;to&nbsp;birth&nbsp;successfully,&nbsp;joyfully&nbsp;and&nbsp;lovingly.</p>	<p>We&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;Catholic&nbsp;community&nbsp;upholding&nbsp;the&nbsp;sanctity&nbsp;of&nbsp;human&nbsp;life&nbsp;through&nbsp;defending,&nbsp;protecting&nbsp;and&nbsp;nurturing&nbsp;the&nbsp;unborn&nbsp;babies&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;moment&nbsp;of&nbsp;conception&nbsp;until&nbsp;their&nbsp;birth.</p>	2026-02-26 10:21:16.210589	2026-02-26 10:21:16.210589
4	Jesus Christ Cares For Cancer, Inc.	60 Chicago St., Cubao, Quezon City	(02) 725 9999		Shepherd’s Voice Radio & Television Foundation, Inc.	Banco De Oro C/A # 3970019804\r\nBanco De Oro S/A # 160506123\r\nAccount No. : 01109 8000 356	/uploads/foundations/logo-1772072640503-851395803.jpg	/uploads/foundations/cover-1772072640505-569712964.png	Cancer Patients	<p>WHEN&nbsp;CARING&nbsp;BECOMES&nbsp;LIVING</p><p>UNLIKELY&nbsp;BLESSING</p><p></p><p>COULD&nbsp;ANYTHING&nbsp;GOOD&nbsp;come&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;tragedy,&nbsp;one&nbsp;might&nbsp;ask.&nbsp;It&nbsp;could.&nbsp;And&nbsp;it&nbsp;did.&nbsp;Jesus&nbsp;Christ&nbsp;Cares&nbsp;For&nbsp;Cancer&nbsp;was&nbsp;born&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;Reylindo&nbsp;“Rey”&nbsp;Ortega’s&nbsp;heart-wrenching&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;with&nbsp;Brian,&nbsp;a&nbsp;7-year-old&nbsp;boy&nbsp;who&nbsp;succumbed&nbsp;to&nbsp;cancer&nbsp;in&nbsp;July&nbsp;2013.&nbsp;The&nbsp;young&nbsp;boy’s&nbsp;passing&nbsp;disturbed&nbsp;him&nbsp;and&nbsp;made&nbsp;him&nbsp;more&nbsp;conscious&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;plight&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;poor&nbsp;afflicted&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;illness.&nbsp;In&nbsp;May&nbsp;2015,&nbsp;Bro.&nbsp;Rey&nbsp;himself&nbsp;was&nbsp;diagnosed&nbsp;with&nbsp;Stage&nbsp;4&nbsp;prostate&nbsp;cancer.&nbsp;With&nbsp;only&nbsp;6&nbsp;months&nbsp;to&nbsp;live,&nbsp;he&nbsp;resolved&nbsp;to&nbsp;spend&nbsp;his&nbsp;remaining&nbsp;days&nbsp;serving&nbsp;indigent&nbsp;cancer&nbsp;patients.&nbsp;JCCFC&nbsp;was&nbsp;officially&nbsp;registered&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;Securities&nbsp;and&nbsp;Exchange&nbsp;Commission&nbsp;on&nbsp;September&nbsp;28,&nbsp;2015.&nbsp;Bro.&nbsp;Rey&nbsp;devoted&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;48&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;his&nbsp;life&nbsp;helping&nbsp;the&nbsp;poor&nbsp;before&nbsp;his&nbsp;passing&nbsp;in&nbsp;June&nbsp;2017.&nbsp;He&nbsp;founded&nbsp;several&nbsp;mercy&nbsp;ministries,&nbsp;including&nbsp;Tahanan&nbsp;ng&nbsp;Pagmamahal,&nbsp;Grace&nbsp;To&nbsp;Be&nbsp;Born,&nbsp;Pag-Asa&nbsp;ng&nbsp;Pamilya&nbsp;Scholarship&nbsp;Foundation,&nbsp;Healthcare&nbsp;Assistance&nbsp;for&nbsp;Indigents&nbsp;and&nbsp;Lepers&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mary&nbsp;(H.A.I.L.&nbsp;Mary),&nbsp;and&nbsp;Jeremiah&nbsp;33:6-7&nbsp;Foundation.&nbsp;The&nbsp;AY&nbsp;Foundation&nbsp;founded&nbsp;by&nbsp;Alfonso&nbsp;Yuchengco&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;Manila&nbsp;Jaycees&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;his&nbsp;humanitarian&nbsp;work&nbsp;by&nbsp;bestowing&nbsp;upon&nbsp;him&nbsp;the&nbsp;Blessed&nbsp;Teresa&nbsp;of&nbsp;Calcutta.</p>	<p>THE&nbsp;FOUNDATION’S&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;hinged&nbsp;on&nbsp;3&nbsp;segments:</p><p>1.&nbsp;Financial&nbsp;help.&nbsp;JCCFC&nbsp;provides&nbsp;weekly&nbsp;financial&nbsp;assistance&nbsp;to&nbsp;indigent&nbsp;cancer-stricken&nbsp;children&nbsp;and&nbsp;adults&nbsp;from&nbsp;various&nbsp;areas&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;country.&nbsp;JCCFC&nbsp;believes&nbsp;it&nbsp;helps&nbsp;them&nbsp;live&nbsp;with&nbsp;dignity&nbsp;like&nbsp;what&nbsp;St.&nbsp;Teresa&nbsp;of&nbsp;Calcutta&nbsp;had&nbsp;done&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;poorest&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;poor.</p><p></p><p>2.&nbsp;Spiritual&nbsp;guidance.&nbsp;JCCFC&nbsp;Prayer&nbsp;Partners,&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;of&nbsp;God-loving&nbsp;intercessors,&nbsp;pray&nbsp;daily&nbsp;and&nbsp;offer&nbsp;masses&nbsp;for&nbsp;specific&nbsp;beneficiaries.&nbsp;We&nbsp;believe&nbsp;prayers&nbsp;are&nbsp;more&nbsp;important&nbsp;than&nbsp;the&nbsp;money&nbsp;we&nbsp;give&nbsp;them.&nbsp;The&nbsp;foundation&nbsp;meets&nbsp;with&nbsp;beneficiaries&nbsp;every&nbsp;month.&nbsp;The&nbsp;fellowship&nbsp;allows&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;bond&nbsp;with&nbsp;other&nbsp;patients,&nbsp;listen&nbsp;to&nbsp;motivational&nbsp;talks&nbsp;and&nbsp;experience&nbsp;spiritual&nbsp;renewal&nbsp;based&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;teachings&nbsp;of&nbsp;Christ.</p><p></p><p>3.&nbsp;Institutional&nbsp;support.&nbsp;JCCFC&nbsp;also&nbsp;extends&nbsp;financial&nbsp;assistance&nbsp;to&nbsp;and&nbsp;arranges&nbsp;outreach&nbsp;programs&nbsp;in&nbsp;charity&nbsp;organizations&nbsp;whose&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;similar&nbsp;to&nbsp;its&nbsp;advocacy.</p>	<p>A&nbsp;haven&nbsp;for&nbsp;sexually&nbsp;abused&nbsp;girls&nbsp;aged&nbsp;18&nbsp;and&nbsp;below&nbsp;directing&nbsp;them&nbsp;toward&nbsp;renewed&nbsp;wholeness&nbsp;and&nbsp;providing&nbsp;them&nbsp;with&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;to&nbsp;heal&nbsp;and&nbsp;mature&nbsp;beautifully&nbsp;so&nbsp;they&nbsp;will&nbsp;become&nbsp;the&nbsp;confident,&nbsp;intelligent&nbsp;women&nbsp;that&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;be.</p>	2026-02-26 10:24:00.597292	2026-02-26 10:24:00.597292
5	He Cares Mission	#9 Mines St., Project 6, Quezon City	(+63) 917 – 629 – 9374	hecares.adm@gmail.com	Bank of the Philippine Islands (BPI)	Account #: 1953-1184-71\r\nAccount Name: HE CARES MISSION STREETCHILDREN CARING CENTER INC.\r\nSwift Code (for international transfers): BOPIPHM	/uploads/foundations/logo-1772072796317-514436697.png	/uploads/foundations/cover-1772072796322-483995368.png	Street Children	<p>He&nbsp;Cares&nbsp;Mission&nbsp;Streetchildren&nbsp;Caring&nbsp;Center&nbsp;Inc.&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;Christian&nbsp;non-profit&nbsp;organization&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Philippines&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;to&nbsp;serving&nbsp;poor&nbsp;and&nbsp;vulnerable&nbsp;street&nbsp;children&nbsp;and&nbsp;families.&nbsp;We&nbsp;provide&nbsp;food,&nbsp;clothing,&nbsp;education,&nbsp;medical&nbsp;assistance,&nbsp;and&nbsp;spiritual&nbsp;support&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;them&nbsp;build&nbsp;a&nbsp;brighter&nbsp;future.</p><p></p><p>Core&nbsp;Values</p><p></p><p>●&nbsp;“To&nbsp;love&nbsp;God&nbsp;and&nbsp;Love&nbsp;Others”</p><p>●&nbsp;Spiritual-Based&nbsp;Helping&nbsp;Process</p><p>●&nbsp;Caring&nbsp;People&nbsp;and&nbsp;Environment</p><p>●&nbsp;Compassionate&nbsp;Team</p><p>●&nbsp;Professionalism</p><p>●&nbsp;Volunteerism</p>	<p>To&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;channel&nbsp;of&nbsp;God’s&nbsp;blessing&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;poor&nbsp;especially&nbsp;the&nbsp;street&nbsp;children</p>	<p>To&nbsp;bring&nbsp;street&nbsp;children&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;personal&nbsp;relationship&nbsp;with&nbsp;Jesus&nbsp;and</p><p>enable&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;live&nbsp;a&nbsp;healthy,&nbsp;honest,&nbsp;normal&nbsp;life&nbsp;and&nbsp;become&nbsp;happy&nbsp;and</p><p>productive&nbsp;individuals&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;society;&nbsp;and&nbsp;equip&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;the&nbsp;love&nbsp;of&nbsp;GOD</p><p>to&nbsp;others</p>	2026-02-26 10:26:36.433722	2026-02-26 10:26:36.433722
